<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif; /* Using serif fonts as a base */
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 10px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  td, th {
    border: 1px solid #000;
    padding: 8px;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .section-header {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <h1 style="text-align: center; font-size: 18pt; margin-bottom: 5px;">2021-22 Verification Worksheet (Dependent Student)</h1>
  <h2 style="text-align: center; font-size: 14pt; margin-top: 0;">Child Support Paid</h2>

  <p>Your 2021-22 FAFSA has been selected by the Department of Education for a review process called verification. On your 2021-2022 FAFSA, you indicated that either you or one of your parents paid child support in 2019. You must verify the amount of child support paid by completing this form and returning it to the Office of Student Financial Aid at Rush University.</p>

  <p>Note: If we have reason to believe that the information regarding child support paid is not accurate, we may require additional documentation, such as:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>A copy of the separation agreement or divorce decree that shows the amount of child support to be provided;</li>
    <li>A statement from the individual receiving the child support certifying the amount of child support received; or</li>
    <li>Copies of the child support payment checks or money order receipts.</li>
  </ul>

  <h3 class="section-header">A. Student Personal Information</h3>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 25%;">Last Name</td>
      <td style="width: 25%;">First Name</td>
      <td style="width: 25%;">M.I.</td>
      <td style="width: 25%;">Rush University ID Number</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="student_personal.last_name">{{ student_personal.last_name }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="student_personal.first_name">{{ student_personal.first_name }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="student_personal.middle_initial">{{ student_personal.middle_initial }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="student_personal.id_number">{{ student_personal.id_number }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Street Address</td>
      <td>Date of Birth</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="student_personal.street_address">{{ student_personal.street_address }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="student_personal.date_of_birth">{{ student_personal.date_of_birth }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>City</td>
      <td>State</td>
      <td>Zip Code</td>
      <td>Email Address</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="student_personal.city">{{ student_personal.city }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="student_personal.state">{{ student_personal.state }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="student_personal.zip_code">{{ student_personal.zip_code }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="student_personal.email_address">{{ student_personal.email_address }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Home Phone Number</td>
      <td>Alternate Phone Number</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td><span data-field="student_personal.home_phone">{{ student_personal.home_phone }}</span></td>
      <td><span data-field="student_personal.alternate_phone">{{ student_personal.alternate_phone }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <h3 class="section-header">B. Child Support Paid</h3>
  <p>The student or spouse, who is a member of the student's household, paid child support in 2019. List below the names of the persons who paid the child support, the names of the persons to whom the child support was paid, the names of the children for whom the child support was paid, and the total annual amount of child support that was paid in 2019 for each child. If more space is needed, provide a separate page that includes the student's name and ID number at the top.</p>

  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Name of Person Who Paid Child Support</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Name of Person to Whom Child Support Was Paid</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Name of Child for Whom Support Was Paid</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;">Amount of Child Support Paid in 2019</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for item in child_support_payments %}
      <tr>
        <td><span data-field="child_support_payments[{{ loop.index0 }}].payer_name">{{ child_support_payments[loop.index0].payer_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="child_support_payments[{{ loop.index0 }}].recipient_name">{{ child_support_payments[loop.index0].recipient_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="child_support_payments[{{ loop.index0 }}].child_name">{{ child_support_payments[loop.index0].child_name }}</span></td>
        <td><span data-field="child_support_payments[{{ loop.index0 }}].amount">{{ child_support_payments[loop.index0].amount }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <h3 class="section-header">C. Certification and Signature</h3>
  <p>I certify that all of the information reported on this worksheet is complete and correct. The student and one parent must sign this worksheet.</p>

  <table style="width: 50%;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%;">Student's Signature</td>
      <td style="width: 50%;">Date</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <table style="width: 50%;">
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 50%;">Parent's Signature</td>
      <td style="width: 50%;">Date</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p style="margin-top: 30px;">Do not mail this worksheet to the U.S. Department of Education.</p>
  <p>Submit this worksheet to the Rush University Office of Student Financial Aid.</p>
  <p>Rush University, Office of Student Financial Aid</p>
  <p><span data-field="institution_address_line1">{{ institution_address_line1 }}</span></p>
  <p><span data-field="institution_address_line2">{{ institution_address_line2 }}</span></p>
  <p>Fax: <span data-field="institution_fax">{{ institution_fax }}</span></p>
</div>